      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email List Cleaner\n\nThis workflow helps clean and validate email addresses from a Google Sheet.  \n\n1. **Get List of Emails**  \n   - Fetches all emails from the Google Sheet named **\"Email\"** in the document.\n\n2. **Code (Validation & Deduplication)**  \n   - Trims and checks if the email format is valid.  ",
        "height": 528,
        "width": 368
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2336,
        -240
      ],
      "id": "e89a852e-ff22-4cfb-a185-331e9ffab5cd",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email Verification with Hunter + Google Sheets Cleanup\n\nThis workflow verifies emails using **Hunter.io** and cleans up a Google Sheet by removing **inactive/invalid emails**.\n\n\n1. **Verify Email with Hunter**  \n   - Uses Hunter.io’s **Email Verifier** to check the deliverability of each email.  \n   - Returns a `status` field (e.g., `valid`, `invalid`).\n\n2. **If Email is Active**  \n   - Checks if the Hunter `status` is **valid**.  \n   - If **Valid** → keeps the email, no further action.  \n   - If **Invalid/Inactive** → continues to the deletion process.\n\n3. **Get Invalid/Inactive Email**  \n   - Looks up the invalid/inactive email in the **Email** sheet of **Important Company Dates**.  \n   - Finds its corresponding row number.\n\n4. **Sort Rows in Descending Order**  \n   - Orders rows from bottom to top.  \n   - Prevents accidental row shifting when deleting multiple entries.\n\n5. **Delete Invalid/Inactive Emails**  \n   - Removes all rows with emails flagged as **invalid/inactive** from the sheet.  \n\n",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 1152
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -976,
        -512
      ],
      "id": "b6aad01e-1b7e-4ce7-bc3a-33c9e9bf37e4",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email List Cleaner (Remove Invalids)\n\nThis workflow ensures only valid emails remain in your Google Sheet. \n\n\n1. **If Email is Valid**  \n   - Checks the `status` field from the previous step.  \n   - Branches into:\n     - **Valid** → Keeps the email.  \n     - **Invalid/Duplicate** → Sends to deletion flow.\n\n2. **Sort Rows in Descending Order**  \n   - Ensures rows are deleted from bottom to top.  \n   - Prevents shifting issues when removing rows in Google Sheets.\n\n3. **Delete Invalid Emails**  \n   - Removes rows that contain invalid or duplicate emails from the **Email** sheet.\n\n4. **Return Nothing**  \n   - Clears out the deleted rows from memory (prevents carrying them further).\n\n5. **Merge**  \n   - Combines the **valid emails** (kept) with the cleaned dataset (without invalids).  \n   - Final result contains only **valid, unique emails**.\n\n",
        "height": 816,
        "width": 928,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1936,
        -512
      ],
      "id": "4a440483-978d-413b-9897-16e1dc771587",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    }
